{"hymn":"S897","parent":"E1329","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Se terminó el gozo de las bodas","subtitle":"El evangelio—General","syl":{"n1":"Se","n2":["ter","i"],"n3":["mi","m"],"n4":["nó","t"],"n5":"el","n6":["go","i"],"n7":["zo","t"],"n8":"de","n9":"las","n10":["bo","i"],"n11":["das","t"],"n12":"Con","n13":"su","n14":["pla","i"],"n15":["cer:","t"],"n16":"el","n17":["vi","i"],"n18":["no","t"],"n19":["se‿a","i"],"n20":["ca","m"],"n21":["bó;","t"],"n23":["A","i"],"n24":["sí","t"],"n25":"la","n26":["vi","i"],"n27":["da‿hu","m"],"n28":["ma","m"],"n29":["na,","t"],"n30":["co","i"],"n31":["mo‿el","t"],"n32":["vi","i"],"n33":["no,","t"],"n35":["Tam","i"],"n36":["bién","t"],"n37":["se‿a","i"],"n38":["go","m"],"n39":["ta‿has","m"],"n40":["ta","t"],"n41":"ver","n42":"a","n43":["Je","i"],"n44":["sús.","t"],"n46":["Lle","i"],"n47":["gó","t"],"n48":["Je","i"],"n49":["sús,","t"],"n50":["cam","i"],"n51":["bio","t"],"n52":"el","n53":["a","i"],"n54":["gua‿en","t"],"n55":["vi","i"],"n56":["no.","t"],"n58":["Lle","i"],"n59":["gó","t"],"n60":["Je","i"],"n61":["sús,","t"],"n62":["lo‿os","i"],"n63":["cu","m"],"n64":["ro‿a","t"],"n65":["di","i"],"n66":["si","m"],"n67":["par.","t"],"n69":"La","n70":["muer","i"],"n71":["te‿Él","t"],"n72":["to","i"],"n73":["ca‿y","t"],"n74":["cam","i"],"n75":["bia‿a","t"],"n76":["vi","i"],"n77":["da‿e","m"],"n78":["ter","m"],"n79":["na,","t"],"n80":"Da","n81":["vis","i"],"n82":["ta‿al","t"],"n83":["cie","i"],"n84":["go,‿y","t"],"n85":["fuer","i"],"n86":["zas","t"],"n87":"al","n88":"que","n89":"cae."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Vino a Jesús de noche un hombre justo;","Buscaba más doctrinas entender.","Ellas no cambian al hombre caído;","Para cambiar, \"tendrás que renacer\"."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Una mujer que no tuvo marido,","Pues muchos la dejaron con más sed,","Tomaba a diario el agua que no sacia;","Se sed cesó, Jesús le dio a beber."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Un hombre en la multitud yacía,","Sin fuerzas para en el estanque entrar.","La religión, la ley, no lo ayudaba;","Le habló Jesús, y lo pudo salvar."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Muerto en la tumba, Lazaro yacía;","Hubo gran duelo y lamentación.","Él fue vendado, preso del silencio;","Jesús llegó, y al muerto despertó."]},{"label":"6.","lines":["Y hasta hoy Jesús es tan viviente;","De toda muerte, Él puede salvar,","Abre tu corazón, Su nombre invoca;","Vendrá a ti, y tú renacerás."]}]}